\section{Error classes}{

Every error carries \code{"metasurvey_error"} plus one of:
\describe{
\item{\code{metasurvey_input_error}}{An argument of an exported function
failed input validation (wrong type, wrong class, missing value).}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_step}}{A step could not be created or baked
(unknown step type, missing variables, failed \code{step_validate()}
checks with \code{.action = "stop"}).}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_recipe}}{A recipe is invalid or cannot be
applied (missing metadata, unmet variable dependencies, dependency
cycles).}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_workflow}}{A workflow object or a
\code{workflow()} estimation is invalid.}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_panel}}{A rotating-panel operation failed
(inconsistent waves, invalid extraction).}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_survey}}{A survey-level operation failed
(design construction, weight or replicate specification).}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_engine}}{The requested processing engine is
not supported or not installed.}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_io}}{A file could not be loaded (unsupported
format, missing reader package, failed download).}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_backend}}{A recipe/workflow backend operation
failed.}
\item{\code{metasurvey_error_backend_unavailable}}{The \code{"api"} backend was
selected but no provider is registered (also carries
\code{metasurvey_error_backend}). Install a provider package such as
\code{metasurvey.explorer.backend}.}
}
