\section{Warning classes}{

Every warning carries \code{"metasurvey_warning"} plus one of
\code{metasurvey_warning_step}, \code{metasurvey_warning_recipe},
\code{metasurvey_warning_workflow}, \code{metasurvey_warning_panel},
\code{metasurvey_warning_survey}, \code{metasurvey_warning_engine} or
\code{metasurvey_warning_backend}, following the same domains as the error
classes.
}

